# Documentation (Cursor)

## Build

```bash
py -3.12 -m mkdocs serve
```

Navigation is defined in `mkdocs.yml`. Add new pages to the `nav` tree.

## Style

Follow `.claude/rules/docs-style.md`: sentence case headings, no em dashes or semicolons, concise technical prose, physics-first where relevant.

Internal design notes under `docs/internal/` are not required to be perfect polish but should stay accurate.
